          <img src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/881ce63c/images/6941b18a1fbcadfc33d9874c_Logo-320.webp" alt="Logeman & Iafrate" class="w-[60px] h-auto" />
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-[36px] lg:text-[44px] font-bold leading-[1.25] text-foreground tracking-normal">Helping You On Your Path To Justice After An Injury In Ann Arbor</h1>
        <p class="text-[16px] font-normal leading-[1.6] text-foreground">After suffering injuries in a life-altering accident or losing a loved one due to someone else's negligence, you deserve the chance to fight for your future and obtain the compensation you need to move forward. At Logeman & Iafrate, P.C., our personal injury and wrongful death attorneys understand the situation you face. We will fight by your side and help guide you through this challenging time with compassion and dedicated legal support.</p>

        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-primary bg-secondary/40 p-6 rounded-r-[8px] italic">
          <p class="text-[18px] text-foreground leading-[1.5]">Our attorneys, <strong>James A. Iafrate</strong> and <strong>Adrienne D. Logeman</strong>, share over 60 years of combined experience representing injured clients in Ann Arbor and throughout Michigan.</p>
        </blockquote>

        <p class="text-[16px] font-medium text-foreground">Our team has a history of taking on and winning cases that other lawyers may consider unwinnable. We are not afraid to go to trial to secure the damages our clients need and deserve.</p>

        <p class="text-[16px] font-normal leading-[1.6] text-foreground">We offer free consultations and operate on a contingency-fee basis, meaning we do not charge legal fees unless we recover damages for you.</p>

        <h2 class="text-[26px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-foreground tracking-[-0.44px] mt-8 mb-4">Providing Comprehensive Personal Injury Representation</h2>
        <p class="text-[16px] font-normal leading-[1.6] text-foreground">Our attorneys are committed to using their decades of successful outcomes to help you recover after your accident. We focus on helping you rebuild your life with the necessary support and compensation. Whether you suffered a spinal cord injury in a motorcycle accident or need help filing a claim against an uninsured driver, you can trust us to provide the legal guidance and support you need.</p>

        <p class="text-[16px] font-normal leading-[1.6] text-foreground">We can help you with a wide range of accident cases, including:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-[16px] text-foreground marker:text-primary">
          <li>Motor vehicle accidents</li>
          <li>Premises liability</li>
          <li>Product liability</li>
          <li>Catastrophic injuries</li>
          <li>Wrongful death</li>
          <li>Construction accidents</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="text-[16px] font-normal leading-[1.6] text-foreground">We strive to ensure that each client feels supported and valued throughout their legal journey. Our ability to handle tough cases and push for the maximum compensation is what sets us apart. This relentless pursuit of justice has resulted in numerous victories across Michigan, making us a trusted name in <strong>personal injury law</strong>. Our attorneys have built a strong reputation for accepting and triumphing in cases that might seem challenging to others, backed by a proven track record of success.</p>

        <h2 class="text-[26px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-foreground tracking-[-0.44px] mt-8 mb-4">Work With Trusted Legal Advocates To Protect Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-[16px] font-normal leading-[1.6] text-foreground">Contact our legal team at Logeman & Iafrate, P.C., today to get started on your personal injury or wrongful death claim. Call us at <a href="tel:(734)994-0200" class="text-primary font-medium underline underline-offset-2"><strong>(734) 994-0200</strong></a> or fill out our <a href="#free-consultation" class="text-primary font-medium underline underline-offset-2"><strong>online contact form</strong></a> to schedule a free consultation at our Ann Arbor office. We take cases on a contingency-fee basis, which means you pay nothing unless we win your case. Let us help you move forward from this challenging time with the compensation you need and deserve.</p>
